# Server Configuration
=======
# INSTRUCTIONS:
# ==========================================
# 1. Get Firebase Admin credentials from Firebase Console:
#    - Go to Project Settings > Service Accounts
#    - Click "Generate New Private Key"
#    - Copy the values from the downloaded JSON file
#
# 2. Get SMTP2GO API key:
#    - Login to SMTP2GO dashboard
#    - Go to Settings > API Keys
#    - Create new API key
#
# 3. In Railway:
#    - Go to your project > Variables
#    - Add each variable above
#    - For FIREBASE_PRIVATE_KEY, paste the entire key including quotes
# ==========================================
